# BearVision 3 open work

- Calibrate BearTag motion/RSSI thresholds from labelled field clips.
- Run end-to-end hardware tests with GoPro preview, capture, BLE and Box.
- Verify model and test-video redistribution rights before a public release.
- Select the BearVision source-code licence before distribution.
- Add explicit CI jobs for training, post-processing GUI and physical hardware.
